# Yatris Content Delivery API, for local builds that read CMS content.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in both values. `.env` is gitignored:
# never commit it, and never paste the key into code, docs or chat.
#
# Where the values come from: ask your agent to call the Yatris MCP tool
# `issue_delivery_key` (it returns both values), or in the Yatris dashboard
# open the site's 接続・診断 page, card "Content Delivery API キー", and press キーを発行.
# The key is shown only once, together with the endpoint.
#
# The key is read-only (`delivery:read`) and reaches published content only.
# `getYatrisList`, `getYatrisSingleton` and `getYatrisItem` from
# `@yatris/astro/delivery` read these at build time; browser code never sees
# them. Deployed builds get their own values from the hosting environment.

# The Website's Delivery endpoint, `<Yatris URL>/api/v1/delivery/<websiteId>`
# (also recorded as `deliveryEndpoint` in .yatris/project.json once paired)
YATRIS_DELIVERY_ENDPOINT=

# A read-only Delivery key (starts with alk_). Revoke it in the dashboard when
# you no longer need it.
YATRIS_DELIVERY_API_KEY=
